+# Phase 14.5.50.1 — Persistent Dark / Light Theme Toggle
+
+## Scope
+- Adds a compact Dark/Light action to the app top bar.
+- Applies the selected theme immediately through the existing `FushTheme` color schemes.
+- Persists the user choice locally with Android `SharedPreferences` so it survives app restarts.
+- Uses the system dark-theme setting only as the initial default when no explicit choice has been stored.
+- Adds Arabic/English labels and accessibility descriptions for the theme action.
+
+## Safety boundary
+Presentation only. No Room schema, DAO, accounting, inventory, production, permissions, backup, or business/domain logic changes.
+
